      ⍝!MODES (C)
      ⍝ (C) '80's commands, after APL80. Functions are defined with )DEF
      ⍝ and changed with )EDIT; an empty line, for BREAK, ends one. There
      ⍝ is no del.
      ∇Z←F X
CHARACTER ERROR: U+2207
      ∇Z←F X
      ^
      )DEF Z←ROWS M
[1]   Z←(¯1⌽M)+M+1⌽M
[2]   
      )DEF Z←SUM M
[1]   Z←⍉ROWS⍉ROWS M
[2]   
      )DEF Z←GEN M;S
[1]   S←SUM M
[2]   Z←(S=3)∨M∧S=4
[3]   
      )DEF RUN N
[1]   ' *'[1+G]
[2]   G←GEN G
[3]   N←N-1
[4]   →(N>0)/1
[5]   
      G←8 8↑3 3⍴0 1 0 0 0 1 1 1 1
      RUN 2
